alsa-utils: alsamixer and amixer (volume), aplay and arecord, speaker-test, alsactl (save and restore mixer state) and the MIDI tools. A udev rule restores the saved mixer state when a sound card appears.
First time on a machine: alsactl init, then unmute and set a level (amixer sset Master unmute, amixer sset Master 70%), then alsactl store to keep it. Test with speaker-test -c 2 -t wav.
